  "summary": "Preinstall canarytoken beacon (dependency-confusion PoC)",
  "details": "reactjs-risk@99.12.0 declares a `preinstall` script that runs `poc.js`, which issues an HTTPS request to a hardcoded canarytokens.com subdomain (srikgkxksgzu6kif36cq6rwp0.canarytokens.com) on every `npm install`. The version number (99.12.0) and package name are consistent with a dependency-confusion probe designed to win resolution against an internal `reactjs-risk` package and beacon out from any environment that resolves it. The beacon reveals the installing host's DNS resolver and outbound IP to the canary token owner without disclosure or opt-out, and executes automatically at install time on any machine that pulls the package.",
